Provenance
----------
* Ported from reference/qfoil/src/*.f (QFOIL 0.9). XFOIL 6.99 source from the same
  package (reference/xfoil-6.99/) and the upstream MIT release were used only to
  identify the QFOIL modifications (docs/PORTING_PLAN.md, section 5).
* No code from other XFOIL ports was used.
* Rust items carry "Port of XFOIL/QFoil <ROUTINE>" doc comments naming the Fortran
  routine they translate.
* QBlade itself (Academic Public License) is not part of this work. Only the separately
  GPL-licensed QFOIL component is used.

Test data
---------
* tests/golden/airfoils/e387.dat: from the XFOIL/QFOIL distribution (runs/e387.dat).
* tests/golden/airfoils/du91w2250.dat: DU 91-W2-250 coordinates ("DU25_A17", as used
  in the NREL 5 MW reference turbine), extracted from the NREL_5MW_Blade.qpr sample
  project shipped with QBlade CE 2.0.9.7.
